  The reel_script and caption say the Supreme Court order was 'வெளியானது' and that the court permitted/decided the matter, but the article only has Arjun Sampath welcoming a Supreme Court permission; the draft's framing of the case details goes beyond the article.
  The reel_script says the 22nd-date protest is 'மாற்றி அமைக்கப்படுகிறது' and that Kandasashti parayanam will be held 'அதற்கு பதிலாக' — the article says the protest was rescheduled/changed to include these events, which the draft presents as a replacement without the article's clear meaning; also the slides say 'நாளை நிகழ்வு' (tomorrow's event) though the article gives no 'tomorrow' and only 'வரும் 22ல்'.
  The reel_script and slides say 'மேலும் செய்திகளுக்கு' and the caption adds 'மக்கள் கவனத்திற்கு' with a call to visit Thiruparankundram; the 'தீப தரிசனம்' call is a phrase from the article, but the slides line 'திருப்பரங்குன்றம் வருவோம்' is placed under 'நாளை நிகழ்வு' implying a scheduled event the article does not state.
